{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c09d0d057c05d8625ea7c58cf3065b9ae0432f00d65425a5c2f5d0372e38efbd", "ja": "（『素敵なキセキ』をイメージした新衣装が完成した。\n未来らしい、良い一着になったな！）", "zh": "（以《美妙的奇迹》为印象设计的新服装完成了。很有未来的风格，是一套很棒的服装！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "354bb49ad22147ac0179f4595173907214479bca21523067503710416015e675", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　この衣装、\n曲のイメージにピッタリじゃないですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！这套服装，\n不是和歌曲的印象超级契合吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "b036bbed63adeae1a0d328310961d71c7d30c66c5972c36a0b7a95734cb23c2a", "ja": "着てるだけでワクワクしてきて、今すぐみんなに\n見てもらいたいです！　それからそれから……。", "zh": "光是穿上它就让人兴奋起来，好想现在就让大家看看！然后还有然后……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e60e6a73f76d3fb2305e25cde40a72b065942351126151ce61346ad2159b307b", "ja": "ははっ、喜んでもらえて嬉しいよ。\nその調子で、アイドルの仕事も頑張ろうな！", "zh": "哈哈，你能这么开心，我也很高兴。就保持这个劲头，偶像的工作也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "78fc31d83c7ac986af19e36f3c5d0b44a8dc3ab4eb4312943debc109a0ac6f4c", "ja": "もちろんです！　素敵な衣装をもらっちゃいましたから\nいっぱいいーっぱい頑張りまーす！", "zh": "那是当然啦！收到这么好看的服装，\n我一定会超——级努力的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "5970f510f8c2e52d7a9c7d8c804f0d614e44f300702610d953d4a55272c069d8", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}さん！\nちょっとこの衣装で踊ってきてもいいですか？", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}先生！\n我可以穿着这套服装去跳一会儿舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e60b48a6e2af0d26e91b668ae1ef2f843867293e73c74b99176c713f85770e0d", "ja": "えっ？　少しならかまわないけど……。\nでもこのあと、公演のレッスンじゃなかったか？", "zh": "咦？稍微跳一会儿倒是没关系……\n不过接下来不是要进行公演的训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "152f6d867b09a3ce47470fff2b31a56952bc2f309896a5f6c1e9d3f6f8abf7b8", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね！\nでへへ、待ちきれなくてつい……。", "zh": "啊，对哦！\n嘿嘿，因为等不及了，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "a73b86744f34baa2584961e774b0f2d8f3781d7555e36c9e34dbff8ea1b3e0b9", "ja": "私、小さい時からこうなんですよね。\n楽しそうって思ったら、そればっかりになっちゃって。", "zh": "我从小就是这样的。\n一旦觉得好像很有趣，就会满脑子都是那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "3cae78af349144ce45f00abc4b5598edfdfcee56a24fb35af1ea0df2546457b5", "ja": "ジャングルジムで遊んでた時も。一番上まで行ったら\nどんな景色が見えるのかな？って気になっちゃって。", "zh": "就连玩攀爬架的时候也是。爬到最上面后，就忍不住好奇那里能看到怎样的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "44ad26e3f0b9b8693a8f0f99fc98c9b00b7e6c4442d04b5428fdcff7afed907c", "ja": "私がのぼってる間、お父さんはずっと危ないよって\n心配して……お母さんはニコニコしてました。", "zh": "我爬的时候，爸爸一直担心地说好危险啊……妈妈则是笑眯眯的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6f61fd91ff3a492f58f5a054c835a4e570a90b3030f60fedad47257a1c6fc3bc", "ja": "あははっ……なんか、想像できる気がするよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈……总觉得能想象到那个画面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "184fb1c684480be9d33d4cf5a038582d512d7a83e3a51382194e989f5f2866d2", "ja": "えへへ……。時間もかかったし、\n手もじんじんして痛かったけど。でも……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……虽然花了不少时间，手也麻麻地疼。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "315014f6e3a36e5ef131e08463fc589f9a98895579accccf345f4d76d91c5f68", "ja": "ちゃんと、てっぺんまで登れたんです！\nそれにすっごくきれいな景色で、嬉しかったなぁ……。", "zh": "我真的登上顶峰了！\n而且景色特别漂亮，真让人开心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1014_p", "source_sha256": "667d9a3499c85a37e4cc26cb2b241b8a02c4d7239c7ac064996a5f83de79451c", "ja": "ははっ、未来らしいエピソードだな。そういう、\n何事も真っすぐ夢中になれるところは、未来の強みだ。", "zh": "哈哈，真是很有未来风格的经历啊。像这样无论什么事都能一心投入，正是未来的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2cd713c1975f063662727b3acae8307db47c3e724a9696e874792ed6d6ae10b7", "ja": "アイドルには様々なワクワクがあるからな。\nこれからも、いろんな楽しみが待ってると思うよ。", "zh": "偶像有各种各样令人心动的地方。\n今后肯定还会有许多快乐在等着我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "d9eaa8aa4793fcd519e9bc06f85f83b9be3579ad8e99e7c1aa36866c55edacca", "ja": "本当ですか～！　もしかしたら、\nまだ出会ってないワクワクもあるのかな～？", "zh": "真的吗～！说不定，还有我们尚未遇见的精彩吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "d4cee0522bee30a7f42ff48fdfa7447336c85914fd56f2275c3ef3dc2e081995", "ja": "アイドルはすごいなーって思ってたけど……\n本当にすごいですね！　{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我本来就觉得偶像很厉害了……没想到真的这么厉害呢！{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e0ec42729f4e861116beeeeb58ddae066dd0d45944f44cac53162a473f86c40e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nそのためにも、このあとのレッスンも頑張ろう。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n为了这个，接下来的课程也要加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "236b8f7c430f84e5a959f961c7bf652bd21a39d23d9ba50362ecd2b7b5d40f91", "ja": "はーい、がんばりまー……\nわあ！？　もうこんな時間ですか～！！", "zh": "好——，加油——……\n哇！？已经这么晚了吗～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e0a92cdab4aba0772c1f501ea7af9fa42b488f407326cb3e3f57b2d9ace1ccc", "ja": "は、早く着替えて、準備運動しなくちゃ！\n{$P$}さん、私先にいきまーす！", "zh": "得、得赶紧换衣服，做准备运动才行！\n{$P$}先生，我先过去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0704_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0704_1021_p", "source_sha256": "84ecc71bd2744c40c7b1f5c54e7bf38c2c172e187e07ebe504d18943141d2a01", "ja": "その前に衣装をここに……！　って行っちゃったか。\nあとで青羽さんに回収してきてもらうか……。", "zh": "在那之前，先把演出服放到这里……！啊，已经走掉了吗。之后让青羽小姐去收回来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
